  "_id": "tg-destruction",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "wicked is reserved to the day of destruction, Job 21:30. destruction that wasteth at noonday, Ps. 91:6. destruction cometh as a whirlwind, Prov. 1:27. mouth of the foolish is near destruction, Prov. 10:14. destruction shall be to the workers of iniquity, Prov. 10:29 (21:15). he that exalteth his gate seeketh destruction, Prov. 17:19. fool’s mouth is his destruction, Prov. 18:7. Before destruction the heart of man is haughty, Prov. 18:12. it shall come as a destruction from the Almighty, Isa. 13:6 (2 Ne. 23:6). wasting and destruction are in their paths, Isa. 59:7 (Rom. 3:16). Destruction upon destruction is cried, Jer. 4:20.",
